  "no_further_issues_reason": "Focused review of 4323320 at 98ca228, independently from its Claude implementer: fresh affected W0/W3/W5 portions cover 24 required landing and 24 privacy cells (390/1440, actual defaults 16/24/32, FI/EN locale and system light/dark), eight locally intercepted a@b invalid-response strips, 48 native zoom cells, navigation and old/new CSS geometry. U1 and U2 are verified. All twelve changed baselines are explicitly approved, with unchanged remaining evidence reused from eef7d25e and f42b0d0f. Ordinary motion was compared with the previous stylesheet; broader harness observations and pre-existing optional footer/motion limits are disclosed rather than counted as new regressions. No blocking, major or minor regression attributable to 4323320 was found. Full W1 referral, W5 company continuation, other response outcomes, keyboard, native POST, asset/performance and reference comparisons are reused explicitly where the diff cannot affect them. Finnish wording/tone and fixed consent text are excluded."
}
